			"notes": "1.8.0 - client-only: server side removed, sync through the external service only\n\nThe mod no longer runs on Minecraft servers at all (\"environment\": \"client\"):\n- removed the \"main\" entrypoint, MorphManager (per-world lucariomod_morphs.json\n  storage) and the dev.lucario.net package (the lucariomod:morph S2C payload)\n- removed the server-side /lucario and /riolu registration and the payload\n  receiver in LucarioClient; LucarioMod is now just the MOD_ID/logger holder\n- morph and emote visibility for other players comes only from the external\n  sync service (WebSocket push + fallback poll + heartbeat); the client\n  /lucario and /riolu commands with MorphApplier are the single apply path\n- README updated: single sync mode, brigadier priority note, 1.8.0 section"
		},
